  "post_content": "<p>(14 fotos) L&#39;alumnat de la fam&iacute;lia de Comer&ccedil; i Marqu&egrave;ting de l&#39;IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; a Onda continua aquest divendres el mercadet solidari amb l&#39;Associaci&oacute; Castell&oacute; contra el C&agrave;ncer (ACCC).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_1306.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Igual que dijous, es pot visitar a la porta de la cantina durant l&#39;hora del pati, de 10.45 a 11.10 hores&nbsp; i es poden comprar productes realitzats per alumnes d&#39;aquesta fam&iacute;lia i tamb&eacute; de la de cer&agrave;mica, aix&iacute; com material promocional de l&#39;associaci&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1300.jpg\" alt=\"img_1300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1301.jpg\" alt=\"img_1301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1302.jpg\" alt=\"img_1302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1304.jpg\" alt=\"img_1304\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1306.jpg\" alt=\"img_1306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1308.jpg\" alt=\"img_1308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadetsolidaricomercies18/img_1311.jpg\" alt=\"img_1311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976